	(text "D3 + Q1: with USB present VSYS comes through D3 and Q1 is off; without it Q1 turns on\nand the cell feeds VSYS. The charger never carries the load.\nU3 ME6211C33 (D7): 500 mA, ~60 uA quiescent. VBAT_SENSE = VBAT / 2 (1M/1M, ~2 uA).\nQ2: nRAIL_EN (GPIO5) LOW = +3V3_SW on. R10 holds the rail off through reset and boot."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 316.23 161.29 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "1d2aaab2-4ad8-5e67-ab85-41897d8e4ea0")
	)
	(text "USB-C sink, 5 V only: CC1/CC2 5.1k to GND. D+/D- go straight to the C3's native USB\n(GPIO19/GPIO18): no USB-UART chip and no ESD chip (D9).\nJ6 (not fitted): 2.54 mm holes for external 5 V or a hand-soldered XY308-2P (D10)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.02 153.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "215e4081-104d-58b2-bcb2-1ee23c48fcc8")
	)
	(text "ESP32-C3-WROOM-02U MODULE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.6083 200.535 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "262aeed0-4f56-5094-8833-df4c6e8aecfc")
	)
	(text "RS485 / MODBUS (FITTED; OMIT TO SAVE COST)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 406.9032 200.535 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "2e0a180d-2537-58a4-9510-a28d7ed77ab0")
	)
	(text "J2 (main) and J3 share one layout, pins 1-10 (D4, D5); J2, J12, J3 and J13 all fitted:\n  1 GND  2 SDA/A  3 SCL/B  4 3V3_SW  5 GND  6 S1/GPIO2  7 3V3_SW  8 GND  9 S2/GPIO4  10 3V3_SW\nEach is two XY308-2.54-5P blocks side by side (no 10-way part at JLCPCB): J2+J12, J3+J13.\nJP2/JP3: J3 pins 2-3 = RS485 A/B as delivered; cut 1-2 and bridge 2-3 for UART0 RX/TX (U5 must then be left off) (D29).\nJ5 (not fitted): GND / GPIO10 / 3V3_SW (D14). R18 (SENS1 pull-up) and C12 (SENS2 filter) fitted; R19, C11 not fitted.\nFirmware: switch +3V3_SW on (GPIO5 low) before any I2C or sensor access."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 229.87 314.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4df35863-676d-53ae-84f3-ac44cf89bfb9")
	)
	(text "GPIO map (D3): USB 18/19, UART0 20/21 -> J3, I2C 6/7, sensors 0/1 (ADC), VBAT_SENSE 3,\nnRAIL_EN 5, LED 8, BOOT 9, spares 2/4 -> J3, 10 -> J5 (RS485 DE when fitted).\nStraps: GPIO2, GPIO8 and GPIO9 must be high at reset (R13, R14, R12).\nJ7 (not fitted): off-board LED, pin 1 = anode, pin 2 = cathode, shares R15.\nC8/C9 close to module pin 1. U.FL antenna: module end at the board edge."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 39.37 297.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "64cd83b0-aef8-516e-b71c-78ced5bd9df3")
	)
	(text "LI-ION CHARGER & CELL PROTECTION"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.3891 66.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "7ed0aeb6-9987-54c7-95da-dc6f30fab087")
	)
	(text "SYSTEM POWER: LOAD SHARING, 3.3 V LDO, SWITCHED SENSOR RAIL"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 311.15 67.185 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "8fe0998c-da05-5146-abfb-c075b82e7dcb")
	)
	(text "PROG: I = 1200 / R. 4.7k = 255 mA (default); bridge JP1 (2.35k) = 510 mA (D8).\nTEMP grounded: no cell thermistor. J4 (not fitted, JST-PH footprint): pin 1 = cell -,\npin 2 = cell +; solder leads or fit a connector by hand (D11). Check cell polarity.\nXB5353A (D12) sits in the cell's negative lead: board GND is the pack's P-.\nTrips at 4.30 V / 2.4 V, 3 A discharge; C3 at its VDD pin."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 162.56 74.93 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "b29f68a0-48f4-570a-af3f-6d739efcbb57")
	)
	(text "USB-C: 5 V IN AND PROGRAMMING"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 67.4473 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "c1483725-e27d-556a-a843-4f183ec85608")
	)
	(text "Fitted by default: J3 pin 2 = A, pin 3 = B via JP2/JP3 (D29). A board without Modbus can leave out\nU5, C13, R20-R23, D5 and J3 (see COST-ESTIMATE.txt). GPIO10 = DE/RE (high = transmit, R20 = receive).\nJP4 bridged = 120R termination. RS485 sensors need their own 5-24 V supply (external)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 414.02 285.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "c22dbc2a-0f02-5eb3-a652-59ba408f503d")
	)
	(text "SENSOR CONNECTORS J2, J3, J13 (FITTED) AND J5 (NOT FITTED)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 224.79 200.535 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "fc2eb401-eff3-5171-a002-96adb044b78e")
	)
